{
  "summary": "r3xdec design is a sophisticated, vibe-centric design system that blends deep slate atmospheric backgrounds with a clean, grid-based feature layout. It utilizes a mix of 'Inter' (sans) for utility, 'Lora' (serif) for emotional headlines, and 'Space Grotesk' for a technical edge. The visual identity relies on glass panels (blur 12px), vibrant indigo accents (#6366f1), and animated glow gradients to create a futuristic, premium feel.",
